{"version":1,"key":"card:567","content":{"id":567,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d993e0da-96b7-4963-a283-b39976f11e5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"CSRF（Cross-site request forgery）的意思是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"跨站请求"},{"type":"formatted","text":"伪造，它利用已登录用户的信息，通过钓鱼网站向已登录的网站发送用户不知道的未授权操作，比如转账操作。常见的手段如在钓鱼网站中搞一个表单，因为用户主动点击提交表单请求会自动携带 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Cookie"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当用户点击时，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Cookie"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就携带过去了，这个操作在服务端就会被认为是合法的，但对于用户来说可能是非法的。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0722e5fb-3285-4dcd-916a-0ee0d1cb5607","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如何预防："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"771e8113-076e-44af-9788-be7387e93bcf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e06ef424-241d-4938-bf4b-e6c6908c7dcf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"790e96cd-36ae-4b5c-ac82-ea81603c0497","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Cookie"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"SameSite"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 设置"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e3495700-53ff-4b74-b823-9407e5f61b6a","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"eb3eee02-8038-40b0-ad50-18f52f15a0b6","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c